					<div class="article__inner">
									<div class="article__content">
						<div class="article__content__wrapper">
								
	<section id="main-content" class="main-content">
					<div class="main-content__intro">
				<p>No one does Christmas like Hollywood and no one does Hollywood like Pulman and Stilgoe! </p>

			</div>
		
					<div class="main-content__text">
				<p>Fresh from the huge success of their movie musicals show <em>Hooray For Hollywood</em> Liza Pulman &amp; Joe Stilgoe tear the wrapping off the festive season in a joyous romp through some of the best loved songs of our movie-musical lives. <em>White Christmas, Meet Me In St Louis, The Muppet Christmas Carol, Elf, Home Alone </em>and many more get the Pulman &amp; Stilgoe Christmas sparkle. <strong> </strong></p>
<p>Come for the holly and the gorgeous harmonies, Liza’s amazing voice, Joe’s virtuoso piano playing and a stocking full of Christmas jollity!</p>

			</div>
			</section>

